B.azk=new A.kW(B.hB,"Thursday Fast","\u0635\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0645\u064a\u0633","Deeds are presented to Allah on Mondays and Thursdays, and the Prophet \ufdfa loved for his deeds to be presented while he was fasting.","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 747, hasan per Darussalam \xb7 Sahih Muslim 1162")
B.azl=new A.kW(B.hB,"Monday Fast","\u0635\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u062b\u0646\u064a\u0646",'The Prophet \ufdfa was asked about fasting on Mondays and said: "That is the day on which I was born and the day on which I was sent (with revelation)." Deeds are also presented on Mondays and Thursdays, and he \ufdfa loved for his deeds to be presented while he was fasting.',"Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 747, hasan per Darussalam")
B.azm=new A.kW(B.ir,"Eid al-Adha \u2014 no fasting","\u0639\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0636\u062d\u0649","The Prophet \ufdfa prohibited fasting on the two Eid days.",u.tD)
B.azn=new A.kW(B.ir,"Eid al-Fitr \u2014 no fasting","\u0639\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0637\u0631","The Prophet \ufdfa prohibited fasting on the two Eid days. Eid al-Fitr is a day of eating, drinking and remembrance of Allah.",u.tD)
B.azo=new A.kW(B.hB,"Day of Ashura","\u064a\u0648\u0645 \u0639\u0627\u0634\u0648\u0631\u0627\u0621",'Fasting the day of Ashura expiates the previous year. When the Prophet \ufdfa came to Madinah he found the Jews fasting it in gratitude for Musa \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 and said: "We have more right to Musa than you." He intended to add the 9th to differ from them \u2014 so fast the 9th with the 10th when you can.',"Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 Sahih al-Bukhari 2004")
B.azp=new A.kW(B.hB,"Six of Shawwal","\u0633\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0634\u0648\u0627\u0644","Whoever fasts Ramadan then follows it with six days of Shawwal, it is as if he fasted a lifetime. These six may be fasted any days of the month, together or apart.","Sahih Muslim 1164")
B.azq=new A.kW(B.ir,"Days of Tashreeq \u2014 no fasting","\u0623\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0634\u0631\u064a\u0642","The days of Tashreeq (11\u201313 Dhul-Hijjah) are days of eating, drinking and remembrance of Allah; fasting them is prohibited except for the pilgrim who cannot afford a sacrificial animal.","Sahih Muslim 1141 \xb7 Sahih al-Bukhari 1997")
B.azr=new A.kW(B.hB,"Tasu\u2019a (9th of Muharram)","\u062a\u0627\u0633\u0648\u0639\u0627\u0621",'The Prophet \ufdfa said: "If I live until next year, I will fast the ninth (along with the tenth)." Fasting the 9th with Ashura follows his \ufdfa intention to differ from the Jews.',"Sahih Muslim 1134")
B.azs=new A.kW(B.Ja,"Ramadan \u2014 obligatory fast","\u0635\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0631\u0645\u0636\u0627\u0646","Fasting Ramadan is an obligation, not a voluntary (sunnah) fast, so the Monday, Thursday and White Days labels do not apply to it. \u201cWhoever of you witnesses the month, let him fast it.\u201d If you are excused, ask a scholar about your own case.","Qur\u2019an 2:185")
B.azt=new A.kW(B.hB,"White Days (13\u201315)","\u0627\u0644\u0623\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0636","The Prophet \ufdfa advised fasting three days of every month \u2014 the 13th, 14th and 15th, the nights of the full moon \u2014 and said fasting three days of each month is like fasting a lifetime.",u.d6)
B.azu=new A.kW(B.hB,"Day of Arafah (for non-pilgrims)","\u064a\u0648\u0645 \u0639\u0631\u0641\u0629","Fasting the Day of Arafah expiates the year before it and the year after it. (For the pilgrim standing at Arafah, the sunnah is not to fast, following the Prophet\u2019s \ufdfa example.)","Sahih Muslim 1162")
