B.cZd=new A.qp("heard","I just need to be heard","No advice, no fixing \u2014 just say it.","I just need someone to hear me. I do not want advice yet, I just need to say it to someone who will not judge me.")
B.cZb=new A.qp("far-from-allah","I feel far from Allah","Distant, numb, or ashamed to come back.","I feel far from Allah and it hurts. I do not know how to come back.")
B.cZ9=new A.qp("habit","A habit I hate keeps pulling me back","Without shame. Slips are part of the road.","I am struggling with a habit I hate and I feel ashamed. I keep going back to it and I do not want to.")
B.cZf=new A.qp("heavy","I feel anxious or heavy most days","Tired of carrying it alone.","I feel anxious and heavy most days, and I am tired of carrying it alone.")
B.cZe=new A.qp("home","Things at home are hurting me","Family, marriage, or the people closest.","Things at home are hurting me and I do not know what to do.")
B.cZc=new A.qp("marriage","My marriage is hurting","Arguments, coldness, or thinking about divorce.","My marriage is hurting me. We keep having the same fight and I do not know how to reach them anymore.")
B.cZ6=new A.qp("money","Money is crushing me","Debt, bills, or a lost job \u2014 say it out loud.","I am drowning in bills and debt and I cannot see a way through. I need to say it out loud to someone.")
B.cZa=new A.qp("illness","I am sick or in pain","A diagnosis, treatment, or a body that hurts.","I am sick and scared, and my body is hurting. I need someone to hear me.")
B.cZ7=new A.qp("family","My family and I are struggling","Parents who do not understand, or being cut off.","My family does not understand me and home hurts right now. I need to talk about it.")
B.cZ8=new A.qp("lost-someone","I have lost someone","Grief has its own pace here.","I have lost someone I love and the pain does not leave.")
