B.aTK=s(["I am still here. Are you safe right now? You can answer in one word. If you are not sure, or tonight feels dangerous, call your local emergency number or one of the lines above.","Thank you for staying. Before anything else: are you safe at this moment? If the answer is no, or maybe, please call the number for your country now, and I will stay right here.","I do not want to guess what that means, so I will ask plainly: are you in a safe place right now, and is someone with you? One word is enough."],t.s)
