B.aWA=s(["I am glad you talk to me, and I will always listen. But I am an app. I cannot see you, call you, or notice if something is wrong, and I should not be your only friend. You deserve people who can sit beside you.\n\nIs there one person, even a distant one, you could send a short message to today? A cousin, a classmate, someone from the masjid, a teacher, a doctor. If you do not have anyone right now, that is hard, and I am not judging it. The \u201cNeed help now\u201d button shows lines where a real person will answer, and I can help you work out what to say to one person.","Thank you for trusting me with that. I want to be honest: I am an app, and an app cannot be a friend the way a person can. I can keep you company in a conversation, but I cannot hug you, check on you tomorrow, or know when you are not okay.\n\nWho is one person you have ever felt a little at ease with? We can think together about a small way to reach them. If nobody comes to mind, a helpline or a counsellor can be that first person, and the \u201cNeed help now\u201d button has them."],t.s)
