B.NE=s(["Still no verified answer for that on my shelf, and I will not guess. The buttons below go to the closest place in the app, and Search looks across every story, guide and du\u2019a. For a ruling, or a case of your own, a qualified scholar is the right person; Our Sources lists one.","I cannot answer that from verified texts. It may help to put it in other words, since a single topic word such as \u201cfasting\u201d or \u201cwudu\u201d often works best. The buttons below go to the closest place in the app, and Search finds a word anywhere in it.","That one is beyond my shelf, so rather than repeat myself: the closest place in the app is the first button below, Search can find a word anywhere in the app, and your local masjid or a qualified scholar can answer what I cannot."],t.s)
