B.NF=s([u.N,"I do not have a checked answer to that on my lesson shelf, and I would rather not guess. H\u0101di in the app is the right place for questions about worship and daily life, or you can ask a teacher you trust. I am happy to go on with your lesson whenever you like.","That one is outside what I teach. I want to give you something true, not a guess. You could ask H\u0101di, or a teacher or a grown-up you trust. If it is about something that worries you, tell me and I will listen.","I cannot find that on my lesson shelf. A grown-up you trust or H\u0101di can help with it. If you would like to carry on with the lesson, I am here."],t.s)
