B.b6A=s(["I am glad you are here. I am an app, though, and you deserve people too. Is there one person who could know a little of this?","I will keep talking with you, and I also want more for you than an app. Who is one person you could trust a little?","This is a good place to talk, and it is not enough on its own. Could we think of one person, or a service, to add?"],t.s)
B.Oq=s(["That is outside what I do: general knowledge, entertainment and prices are not on my shelf, and I would not be a reliable source. I answer about Islam: worship, the Qur\u2019an and the Sunnah, halal and haram, family, belief and history, and where things are in this app."],t.s)
