B.bZ9=new A.eO(["Makkah","The night of the departure","The disbelievers plotted \u201cto restrain you or kill you or evict you\u201d (8:30). The Prophet \ufdfa left Makkah with Abu Bakr and made for a cave on the mountain of Thawr.","Qur\u2019an 8:30 \xb7 Sahih al-Bukhari 3905"])
B.bZb=new A.eO(["The Cave of Thawr","Three nights in the cave","With Abu Bakr beside him he said: \u201cdo not grieve; indeed Allah is with us\u201d (9:40). They stayed in the cave three nights. Later tradition adds a spider\u2019s web; it is not in the Qur\u2019an or in Bukhari 3905.","Qur\u2019an 9:40 \xb7 Sahih al-Bukhari 3905"])
B.bZx=new A.eO(["The Road North","Suraqa and the sinking horse","Suraqa ibn Malik rode after them for the reward Quraysh had announced, equal to a blood-price. His horse stumbled, then sank into the ground up to its knees. He called for safety, told them what Quraysh planned, and was asked: \u201cDo not tell others about us.\u201d","Sahih al-Bukhari 3906"])
B.bZj=new A.eO(["Quba","The first stop near Madinah","He stayed with Banu Amr ibn Awf at Quba: fourteen nights in Bukhari 3932, ten in Bukhari 3906. The Qur\u2019an speaks of \u201ca mosque founded on righteousness from the first day\u201d (9:108), understood to be Masjid Quba.","Sahih al-Bukhari 3932, 3906 \xb7 Qur\u2019an 9:108"])
B.bZp=new A.eO(["Madinah","The city that came out to see him","The news spread in Madinah and the people came out saying, \u201cAllah\u2019s Prophet has come!\u201d He alighted near the house of Abu Ayyub.","Sahih al-Bukhari 3911"])
