B.b8x=s(["The Family Wing is for parents and guardians. A parent adds a child; a child never needs an account.","We store a first name or nickname you choose, an age band you choose (5-8, 9-12 or 13-17, so Wasia uses suitable words), and the child\u2019s lesson and exam progress. Nothing else: no exact age, photo, voice, contact details or location.","By default all of it stays on this device. Only if you sign in with your own account and switch on \u201cSend my children\u2019s progress to my account\u201d does a summary (no name) go to your account, so you can see it from your phone. You can switch it off at any time and the copy is deleted. It is never sent to any AI service. Wasia is never given a child\u2019s name or progress.","Questions a child asks Wasia are answered from the app\u2019s own lessons. The AI service is off for children until you turn it on. If you do, the question the child types is sent, with no name, progress or profile. When a child asks from inside a lesson, the text of that lesson (the app\u2019s own wording, which says nothing about the child) goes with the question, so the answer stays about the lesson. You can turn it off again.","What you type as a parent into \u201cAsk Wasia\u201d in the Family Wing is your own question. If an AI key or subscription is set up, it may be sent to the AI service while the parent check is open, with no child\u2019s name or progress.","You can delete one child, or everything, at any time from the Family Wing. Deleting removes the name and all progress from this device straight away.","Online game tables (Ludo and Shatranj, by a six-letter code) are OFF for every child, and there is no switch to turn them on for a child. Only a grown-up using the app as themselves can use them. A table shows only \u201cPlayer 1\u201d and \u201cPlayer 2\u201d: no name, e-mail or profile is sent, and there is no chat. It is deleted when a player leaves and cannot be opened after six hours.","There is no advertising, no tracking and no analytics about children in the app."],t.s)
