B.b8J=s(["A grown-up who looks after this app can see your nickname, which lessons you have finished, and your scores in the little tests.","They cannot see what you type to Wasia, or what you say when Wasia asks how you are.","Wasia does not keep what you say. Wasia cannot tell anyone for you, and the app does not tell anyone."],t.s)
