B.auj=new A.cW("Do not hate one another, do not envy one another, do not turn away from one another \u2014 and be, O servants of Allah, brothers.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6065 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.auC=new A.cW("A Muslim is the brother of a Muslim: he does not wrong him, nor forsake him, nor despise him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564",null,null)
B.auy=new A.cW("Whoever relieves a believer\u2019s distress, Allah will relieve his distress on the Day of Resurrection.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.aue=new A.cW("Be in this world as if you were a stranger or a traveler.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6416",null,null)
B.aum=new A.cW("If you were to rely upon Allah with true reliance, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds.","Umar ibn al-Khattab (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2344","hasan","Darussalam")
B.aua=new A.cW("Truthfulness leads to righteousness, and righteousness leads to Paradise.","Abdullah ibn Mas\u2018ud (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6094 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.aul=new A.cW("The best among you are those who are best to their families, and I am the best of you to my family.","Aisha (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3895","hasan","Darussalam")
B.auS=new A.cW("He is not of us who does not show mercy to our young and honor our elderly.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1919","hasan","Darussalam")
B.auJ=new A.cW("The Merciful are shown mercy by the Most Merciful; be merciful to those on earth and the One above the heavens will be merciful to you.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4941","sahih","al-Albani")
B.au1=new A.cW(u.AR,"Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4811","sahih","al-Albani")
B.atZ=new A.cW(u.ql,"Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6412",null,null)
B.au4=new A.cW("Richness is not having many possessions; richness is contentment of the soul.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6446",null,null)
B.auu=new A.cW("Convey from me, even if it is only one verse.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 3461 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.au6=new A.cW("Allah makes the way to Paradise easy for whoever travels a path seeking knowledge.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.aus=new A.cW("When a man dies, his deeds end except three: ongoing charity, beneficial knowledge, or a righteous child who prays for him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 1631",null,null)
B.auO=new A.cW("The religion is sincerity \u2014 to Allah, to His Book, to His Messenger, and to the leaders of the Muslims and their common folk.","Tamim ad-Dari (RA)","Sahih Muslim 55",null,null)
B.auN=new A.cW("Whoever fasts Ramadan out of faith and hope for reward, his previous sins are forgiven.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 38",null,null)
B.auG=new A.cW("Whoever prays the two cool hours (Fajr and Asr) will enter Paradise.","Abu Musa al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 574",null,null)
B.au3=new A.cW("The closest a servant is to his Lord is while he is prostrating \u2014 so make much dua.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 482",null,null)
B.auq=new A.cW("Allah descends in the last third of the night and says: Who calls upon Me that I may answer him?","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1145 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.auL=new A.cW("Spread the greeting of peace, feed others, and pray at night while people sleep \u2014 you will enter Paradise in peace.","Abdullah ibn Salam (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2485","sahih","Darussalam")
B.auk=new A.cW("The seven whom Allah will shade on the day there is no shade but His\u2026 (among them) a person whose eyes shed tears in private out of reverence for Allah.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 660 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.au0=new A.cW("Whoever says SubhanAllah one hundred times, a thousand good deeds are recorded for him.","Sa\u02bfd ibn Abi Waqqas (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2698",null,null)
B.auD=new A.cW("If somebody innovates something which is not in harmony with the principles of our religion, that thing is rejected.","Aisha (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2697",null,null)
B.aun=new A.cW("Whoever sends one blessing upon me, Allah sends ten blessings upon him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 408",null,null)
B.auF=new A.cW("There is a gate in Paradise called Ar-Rayyan through which those who fasted will enter, and none will enter through it except them.","Sahl ibn Sa\u2019d (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1896",null,null)
B.auR=new A.cW("Allah accepts the repentance of His servant so long as the death-rattle has not reached his throat.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3537","hasan","Darussalam")
B.auQ=new A.cW(u.A5,"Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2749",null,null)
B.auH=new A.cW("Whoever fulfils the need of his brother, Allah will fulfil his need.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2442 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.auE=new A.cW("Allah is happier with the repentance of His servant than one of you who finds his lost camel in the desert.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.aud=new A.cW(u.i4,"Jabir ibn Abdullah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2877",null,null)
B.au9=new A.cW("Amazing is the affair of the believer \u2014 all of it is good for him: gratitude in ease, patience in hardship.","Suhayb ar-Rumi (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2999 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.aut=new A.cW("No fatigue, illness, worry or grief touches a Muslim, even the prick of a thorn, but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.au5=new A.cW(u.r8,"Usamah ibn Zayd (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1284 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
