B.aBi=new A.ip("taqwa","Being mindful of Allah: doing what pleases Him and staying away from what displeases Him, in public and in private.",B.b)
B.aBo=new A.ip("nisab","The minimum amount of wealth a person must hold before zakat is due on it.",B.b)
B.aBF=new A.ip("hawl","The lunar year that wealth is held for. Zakat on savings is due once the nisab has been held for a full hawl.",B.b)
B.bBl=s(["zakah"],t.s)
B.aBC=new A.ip("zakat","The yearly giving of a set share of one\u2019s savings to people in need. It is one of the five pillars of Islam.",B.bBl)
B.aBf=new A.ip("riba","Interest or usury: an extra amount charged on a loan. Islam forbids it. Scholars discuss its exact limits in detail.",B.b)
B.aBL=new A.ip("qada","Making up a prayer or a fast that was missed.",B.b)
B.aBd=new A.ip("tawaf","Walking around the Kaaba seven times as an act of worship, in Hajj and in Umrah.",B.b)
B.ba5=s(["sa\u2019i"],t.s)
B.aBP=new A.ip("sa'i","Walking seven times between the hills of Safa and Marwah, in Hajj and in Umrah.",B.ba5)
B.aBQ=new A.ip("Arafat","The plain near Makkah where pilgrims stand in prayer on the ninth day of Dhul-Hijjah. It is the high point of Hajj.",B.b)
B.aBA=new A.ip("Muzdalifah","A place between Arafat and Mina where pilgrims stop on the night after Arafat during Hajj.",B.b)
B.aBw=new A.ip("Mina","A valley near Makkah where pilgrims stay for some days during Hajj.",B.b)
B.aBB=new A.ip("ihram","The state a pilgrim enters, with the intention for Hajj or Umrah, which begins the pilgrimage.",B.b)
B.aBq=new A.ip("Umrah","The smaller pilgrimage to Makkah, which can be made at any time of the year.",B.b)
B.aBt=new A.ip("barakah","Blessing: goodness and increase that Allah places in something, beyond what can be counted.",B.b)
B.aBr=new A.ip("halal","Permitted in Islam.",B.b)
B.aBJ=new A.ip("haram","Forbidden in Islam.",B.b)
B.aBv=new A.ip("niyyah","Intention: the decision in the heart to do an act for the sake of Allah.",B.b)
B.aBy=new A.ip("sadaqah","Voluntary charity: any giving or kindness offered for the sake of Allah, beyond the required zakat.",B.b)
B.aBG=new A.ip("wudu","The washing a Muslim does before prayer.",B.b)
B.aBD=new A.ip("salah","Prayer, above all the five daily prayers, the second pillar of Islam.",B.b)
B.aBb=new A.ip("dhikr","Remembrance of Allah, for example by repeating His praise.",B.b)
B.aBn=new A.ip("sunnah","The way of the Prophet \ufdfa: what he said, did and approved.",B.b)
