B.cHq=new A.mf("Abu Bakr \u2014 The Steady One","The first caliph: 'If you worship Muhammad, know that he has died; but if you worship Allah, He lives and does not die.' He saved zakat and saved the deen in two years.","comp-abu-bakr")
B.cHl=new A.mf("Umar \u2014 Justice on Horseback","The second caliph, who patrolled Medina at night and answered to no one but Allah \u2014 the milk-seller\u2019s story is his most told parable of fairness.","comp-umar")
B.cHk=new A.mf("The Pot of Milk","A report (Muwatta Malik, through Zayd ibn Aslam) that Umar made himself vomit milk he learned came from the zakat camels. A report, not an eyewitness chain; scholar review needed.","tale-umar-milk")
B.cHf=new A.mf("Uthman \u2014 The Gatherer of the Quran","The third caliph: gentle by nature, decisive when it mattered \u2014 he ordered the one mushaf, and the ummah has read from it ever since.","comp-uthman")
B.cHm=new A.mf("Ali \u2014 Raised in the Prophet\u2019s House","The fourth caliph, raised in the Prophet\u2019s house \u2014 the era\u2019s scholarship begins with him.","comp-ali")
