B.bux=s([u.k,"Salam. I am H\u0101di. Ask me about worship, the Qur'an or where something lives in this app. If something heavy is on your heart, you can tell me that too, and I will listen.","As-Salaamu Alaikum. This is H\u0101di. Bring me a question about your deen or this app, or just tell me how things are. We can go at your pace.","Peace be with you. I am H\u0101di, here to point you to authentic knowledge and to listen when life feels heavy. What is on your mind?"],t.s)
