B.bvg=s(["If something is making you sad or scared, or someone is hurting you, the best thing is to tell a grown-up you trust: a parent, a teacher, an aunt or uncle. You can tell them more than once, until someone listens.","If you do not know who to tell, press \u201cNeed to talk to someone?\u201d on the Kids Corner page. It shows people you can call or text who help children.","Nothing in this app is a secret from the grown-ups who keep you safe. If someone asks you to keep a secret that makes you feel bad, you do not have to."],t.s)
