B.asV=new A.X("faith-doubt",B.aYk,B.bgP,'Thank you for telling me this. It is not easy to say, and I will not rush to fix you or lecture you.\n\nDoubt is more common than people admit, and it is not the same as having left. Some of the Companions came to the Prophet \ufdfa troubled by thoughts they felt were too terrible to say out loud. He did not shame them (Sahih Muslim 132). Ibrahim \ufdfa asked Allah to show him how He gives life to the dead; when Allah asked "Have you not believed?" he said "Yes, but [I ask] only that my heart may be satisfied" (Qur\'an 2:260). Wanting the heart settled is not the same as denying.\n\nSome things that often help:\n- Say what the doubt is actually about. Is it a question (why is there suffering, how do I know the Qur\'an is preserved, how do I know there is a God)? Is prayer feeling empty? Did someone in the community hurt you? Each needs a different answer. Tell me in your own words and I will answer from the sources where I can, and say plainly where I cannot.\n- Do not carry it alone. A trusted teacher or imam who can listen without panicking, or a friend, is worth finding. A scholar can answer what I cannot.\n- Keep the small things you can: a short prayer, a few ayat, a single honest sentence to Allah. Faith rises and falls; it is not always at the same height. Allah says: "And when My servants ask you, [O Muhammad], concerning Me - indeed I am near" (Qur\'an 2:186).\n- If this comes with heaviness, hopelessness or thoughts of harming yourself, please tell me, and I will take that first. "Need help now" opens help lines for your country.\n\nI am an app, not a person or a scholar, and I cannot see your heart. What I can do is stay with the question with you.\n\nSource: Sahih Muslim 132; Qur\'an 2:260, 2:186.\n[GO:/academy/aqeedah]\n[GO:/feelings]',"faith",!0,"")
B.byb=s(["\\bapostas\\w*\\b","\\bapostates?\\b","\\bmurtad\\w*\\b","\\briddah\\b","\\bridda\\b","\\b(?:leaving|leave|leaves|left|quit|quitting|abandon\\w*|renounc\\w*|exit\\w*) (?:from )?(?:the )?(?:islam|religion of islam)\\b.*\\b(?:punish\\w*|death|kill\\w*|penalty|penalties|ruling|rulings|law|laws|sin|allowed|permitted|haram|consequences?|crime|executed|execution|hell|fire)\\b","\\b(?:punish\\w*|death|kill\\w*|penalty|penalties|ruling|rulings|law|laws|sin|allowed|permitted|haram|consequences?|crime|executed|execution)\\b.*\\b(?:leaving|leave|leaves|left|quit|quitting|abandon\\w*|renounc\\w*) (?:from )?(?:the )?islam\\b","\\bwhat happens (?:if|when) (?:a )?(?:muslim|someone|you|i|one|people) (?:leave|leaves|left|quit|quits|abandons?) islam\\b","\\bcan (?:a )?(?:muslim|someone|you) (?:leave|quit|abandon) islam\\b","\\bfreedom of (?:religion|belief|faith|conscience)\\b","\\bcompulsion in religion\\b","\\bis it (?:true|a fact) that (?:muslims|ex muslims|people who leave islam)\\b.*\\b(?:killed|executed|die|death)\\b","\\bex muslims?\\b"],t.s)
