B.aq0=new A.X("hadi-who",B.aNN,B.RH,'I am Hadi, the guide in Ar-Rayaan. The name means "the guide". I answer from a library built into the app: the Qur\'an, the six hadith collections and the app\'s own guides, and every answer shows where it comes from.\n\nI am an app, not a person, and not a scholar. If you want to know what I can help with, ask "what can you do".\n[GO:/sources]',"about hadi",!0,"")
B.bmB=s(["\\bwho made you\\b","\\bwho (?:built|created|developed|designed|programmed|wrote|coded|owns|trained|invented) (?:you|hadi)\\b","\\bwho is your (?:maker|creator|developer|owner|author)\\b","\\bwho are your (?:makers?|creators?|developers?|owners?)\\b","\\bwho is behind (?:you|hadi)\\b","\\bwho (?:wrote|writes) your answers\\b"],t.s)
B.atp=new A.X("hadi-maker",B.bmB,B.b,"I am part of Ar-Rayaan, which is an app of RHW Technologies. Its owner is Abdul G Khokhar. That is what the app states, and it is all I know about who is behind me: it gives no funder, address or company details, so I will not guess any.\n\nMy answers are not written one by one by a person while we talk. They come from a library built into the app, and each one shows the Qur'an verse or hadith it rests on. No scholar has reviewed the library yet, and the app says so on its Sources page.\n[GO:/sources]","about hadi",!0,"")
B.b9Y=s(["\\b(?:are you|is hadi|is this|r u)\\b.*\\b(?:openai|open ai|chatgpt|chat gpt|gpt|gemini|claude|anthropic|grok|llama|deepseek|copilot|bard|mistral|an llm|a language model)\\b","\\b(?:you|hadi|this app|the app)\\b.*\\b(?:made|built|powered|run|running|trained|based|created|developed|using|uses|use)\\b.*\\b(?:openai|open ai|chatgpt|chat gpt|gpt|gemini|claude|anthropic|grok|llama|deepseek|copilot|bard|mistral)\\b","\\bwhat (?:ai|model|llm|language model|technology|engine) (?:are you|do you use|is this|is hadi|are you using|powers you|do you run on|is behind you)\\b","\\bwhich (?:ai|model|llm|language model) (?:are you|do you use|is this|is hadi|powers you)\\b","\\bwhat powers you\\b","\\bare you (?:powered|run) by\\b","\\bare you (?:an? )?(?:llm|large language model|neural network)\\b"],t.s)
B.at8=new A.X("hadi-model",B.b9Y,B.b,'No. I am not made by OpenAI or by any other AI company, and the app names no model for me. By default my answers come from a library built into the app: the Qur\'an, the six hadith collections and the app\'s own guides, matched to your question on your device, with the source printed under each answer.\n\nTwo things are optional, and both are off unless you turn them on:\n- If you add your own AI account (in my menu, "Your own AI account"), your questions then go to the provider you chose, under that provider\'s terms. Those replies are not from the library and have not been reviewed.\n- In Settings, under Support and wellbeing, "Use the online model for support chats" is off by default. Only if you turn it on can what you type in a support chat be sent to the online model Ar-Rayaan is connected to. It is never used when a message looks like an emergency or abuse, or when a child is speaking, and your own AI key is never used for it.\n\nThe Privacy policy in Settings lists every outside service the app can reach.\n[GO:/settings]\n[GO:/sources]',"about hadi",!0,"")
B.byY=s(["^(?:can you )?(?:issue|give|make) (?:me )?(?:a )?fatwa\\b","\\b(?:give|issue|make|write) (?:me )?(?:a )?fatwa\\b","\\bi (?:want|need) (?:a )?fatwa\\b","\\bwhat is a fatwa\\b.*\\byou\\b","\\bdo you give fatwas?\\b","^(?:can you )?give (?:islamic )?rulings?\\b","\\bare you (?:a )?(?:mufti|qualified to give fatwas?)\\b"],t.s)
B.apF=new A.X("hadi-fatwa",B.byY,B.b,"I cannot give a fatwa. A fatwa is a ruling from a qualified mufti who knows your situation and can ask you questions, and I am an app with a library, not a mufti.\n\nWhat I can do is show you what the Qur'an and the hadith say on a question, with the source and the hadith grade, and say where the four schools differ. That is a study aid, not a ruling for your case.\n\nFor a ruling on your own situation, such as a marriage, a debt, an inheritance or whether your worship is valid, ask a qualified scholar of your school in person. \"Your school of law\" in my menu lets me name your school when I point you to one, and the Huda guides show each guide's school note.\n[GO:/huda]\n[GO:/sources]","about hadi",!0,"")
B.aRC=s(["\\bwhat can (?:you|hadi) do\\b","\\bwhat (?:do|can) you (?:help|know)\\b","\\bhow can you help\\b","\\bwhat can i ask\\b","\\bwhat should i ask\\b","\\bhelp me\\b$","^help$","\\bwhat topics\\b","\\bwhat do you cover\\b","\\bwhat are your (?:features|abilities|capabilities)\\b","\\bhow (?:do|does) (?:you|hadi) work\\b","\\bare you (?:an? )?(?:ai|bot|robot|human|real|person|scholar|sheikh|shaykh|imam|mufti|alim)\\b","\\bis this (?:an? )?(?:ai|bot|human|person)\\b","\\bcan i trust you\\b","\\bare you reliable\\b","\\bare your answers (?:correct|right|accurate|reliable)\\b","^(?:can you )?make mistakes\\b","\\bdo you make mistakes\\b"],t.s)
B.aoM=new A.X("hadi-about",B.aRC,B.RH,'I am Hadi, the guide inside this app. I am not a scholar, a sheikh or a mufti, and I cannot issue a fatwa. I answer from a built-in library of the Qur\'an and the Sunnah, show where each answer comes from (the source card gives the collection, the number, and for hadith the grade and who graded it), and take you to the right screen of the app.\n\nI can help with:\n- Worship: wudu, ghusl, prayer, fasting, zakat, Hajj and Umrah, funerals.\n- What is halal and haram in food, money and everyday life, and family and marriage questions.\n- The basics of belief, the Prophet\'s life, the companions and Islamic history.\n- Du\'as, and where to find things in the app: Qur\'an, Prayer Times, Qibla, Games, the Academy and more.\n\nWho made the app: RHW Technologies. The owner is Abdul G Khokhar.\n\nWho has reviewed this: no one yet. The app\'s own words are "Scholar review needed. No named scholar has reviewed this app yet. We check every citation we can, we say so when we cannot, and we will name a reviewer here only once one has agreed to be named."\n\nWhere the schools of law differ, I say so and do not pick one for you. For a ruling on your own case (a divorce, an inheritance, a debt), I will not guess: a qualified scholar who can ask you questions must answer. I can be wrong, so please treat my answers as a study aid and check the source. If I do not know something, I say so.\n\nI answer in English only. Ask me anything about Islam or the app, for example "how many rak\'ahs is Fajr", "is gelatin halal" or "how do I play Ludo".\n[GO:/sources]',"about hadi",!0,"")
B.aNW=s(["\\bstreaks?\\b","\\bpoints?\\b.*\\b(?:app|hadi|game|games|quran|prayer|worship|earn|get|score|reward)\\b","\\b(?:app|hadi|game|games|worship)\\b.*\\bpoints?\\b","\\bcoins?\\b","\\bbadges?\\b","\\bleaderboards?\\b","\\blevels? up\\b","\\bgamif\\w*\\b","\\bdays returned\\b","\\bcome back (?:streak|calendar)\\b","\\breward(?:s)? (?:in|for) the app\\b","\\bdoes the app (?:track|count|score)\\b","\\bwhat is keep my streaks\\b","\\bturn (?:off|on) streaks?\\b","\\bkeep a private log\\b","\\bmy log\\b","\\bprivate log\\b"],t.s)
