B.as4=new A.X("tracking-points",B.aNW,B.bwB,'Ar-Rayaan does not count days in a row, and nothing in it starts over when you take a break. If you like, you can keep a private log: the switch is called "Keep a private log", in Settings under "Coming back" and on the My log screen.\n\nWhen it is on, the app adds up what you read in the Qur\'an, your dhikr and tasbeeh and your lessons. My log also reads your own prayer log and fasting log. You see plain totals for this week, this month and all time, the last day you logged, and a calendar of the days you logged. A day with nothing on it is just empty space. It all stays on your device and is never shared.\n\nThere are no points, coins, ranks or leaderboards for worship anywhere in the app, and no scolding when you have been away: when you come back you are simply welcomed. If you switch the log off, the days it saved for Qur\'an, dhikr and lessons are erased; your prayer log and fasting log stay as they are.\n[GO:/my-log]\n[GO:/settings]',"my log",!0,"")
B.b1e=s(["\\b(?:change|switch|set|choose|pick|select|use) (?:the |my )?(?:app )?language\\b","\\blanguage (?:of|in|for|settings?|options?|menu)\\b.*\\b(?:app|hadi)\\b","\\b(?:app|hadi)\\b.*\\blanguages?\\b","\\bis (?:the )?(?:app|hadi) (?:available|translated|offered) in\\b","\\b(?:does|can) (?:the )?(?:app|hadi) (?:speak|understand|support|answer in|reply in|work in|talk in)\\b","\\b(?:app|hadi) in (?:urdu|arabic|bangla|bengali|french|turkish|malay|indonesian|hindi|spanish|german|english)\\b","\\b(?:urdu|arabic|bangla|bengali|french|turkish|malay|indonesian|hindi|spanish|german) (?:version|language|translation|support)\\b.*\\b(?:app|hadi)\\b","\\btranslate the app\\b","\\blanguage and voice\\b","\\blanguage \\& voice\\b","\\bwhich languages\\b","\\bwhat languages\\b","\\bavailable languages\\b","\\bvoice (?:reading|read aloud|reader)\\b","\\bread (?:it |answers? |text )?aloud\\b","\\btext to speech\\b","\\bmy language\\b"],t.s)
B.bf6=s(["\\b(?:learn|teach|lessons?|school|arabic letters|quranic arabic|grammar)\\b"],t.s)
B.aog=new A.X("language-help",B.b1e,B.bf6,'You change the language on the Language & Voice screen: open the menu and choose "Language & Voice" (or Settings, then the language row). The app offers English, Urdu, Arabic, Indonesian, French, Turkish, Bangla and Malay, but not all of them are translated yet, and the screen says so for each one:\n- Arabic, Bangla and Urdu: the menu and tab names, the titles on the Home screen, the first questions you see when you open the app, and the top of Settings are translated. These are first drafts waiting for a native speaker to check them. Arabic and Urdu also turn the layout right-to-left.\n- Indonesian: only the Language & Voice labels are translated.\n- French, Turkish and Malay: not translated yet; the app stays in English.\n\nLessons, stories, hadith, my answers, the prayer screens and every long text are still in English, with the original Arabic for scripture. I answer in English only. When I read aloud, I use the voices installed on your phone. On the same screen you can choose my voice and Wasia\'s, hear each one first, set the speed, and have Arabic read in Arabic.\n[GO:/settings/language]',"language",!0,"")
B.bcp=s(["\\bdownloads?\\b","\\bdownload(?:ing)? (?:the )?(?:quran|recitation|audio|surah|reciter|ayah|app|nasheed|content|duas?|lessons?)\\b","\\boffline\\b","\\bwithout (?:the )?(?:internet|wifi|wi fi|data|network)\\b","\\bno (?:internet|wifi|wi fi|network|connection|signal)\\b","\\b(?:work|works|working|use|using) (?:the )?(?:app )?(?:offline|without internet)\\b","\\bsave (?:the )?(?:recitation|audio|surah|quran)\\b","\\bstorage\\b","\\bdata usage\\b","\\bmobile data\\b","\\bhow much space\\b","\\bdelete (?:a |my |the )?downloads?\\b","\\bremove (?:a |my |the )?downloads?\\b"],t.s)
