B.bL7=new A.J7("mustafa-jan-e-rahmat","Mustafa Jaan-e-Rahmat \xb7 the first lines","\u0645\u0635\u0637\u0641\u06cc\u0670 \u062c\u0627\u0646\u0650 \u0631\u062d\u0645\u062a \u067e\u06c1 \u0644\u0627\u06a9\u06be\u0648\u06ba \u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645","Imam Ahmad Raza Khan (1856\u20131921)","Salam to the Prophet \ufdfa","ur","The best loved Urdu salam, sung in gatherings across South Asia, from the collection Had\u0101\u02beiq-i Bakhshish (1907). It is long; only the opening couplet and the couplet in praise of Ab\u016b Bakr are here, because those are the lines whose wording was checked. The poet died in 1921, so the poem is in the public domain.","Wording as quoted from the salam by musjidulhaq.com (the opening couplet) and dawateislami.net (the couplet on Ab\u016b Bakr). Published text of Had\u0101\u02beiq-i Bakhshish still has to be checked line by line.",B.aSs)
