B.bNI={sadness:0,anxiety:1,loneliness:2,far:3,exhaustion:4,comparison:5,home:6,marriage:7,money:8,illness:9,family:10,shame:11,despair:12,heard:13}
B.br9=s(["That sadness sounds heavy, and you have been carrying it quietly. I am listening. What does it feel like today?","It hurts, and you do not have to pretend otherwise here. Where is the sadness sitting right now?"],t.s)
B.b11=s(["That constant worry sounds exhausting, like your mind never gets to rest. What is it circling most right now?","Anxiety can make everything feel urgent at once. I am listening. What is the loudest worry tonight?"],t.s)
B.bdJ=s(["Feeling so alone, unseen by everyone around you, is a real pain, not a small one. What would you want someone to finally understand?","Carrying this alone makes it twice as heavy. You are heard here. Who comes closest to noticing, even a little?"],t.s)
B.aZC=s(["Feeling far from Allah hurts precisely because you care. That ache is a heart that wants Him, not one that has left Him. What does the distance feel like?","That distance you feel from Allah is not proof He has left you; it is proof you miss Him. Tell me what it feels like."],t.s)
B.be_=s(["You sound completely worn down, body and heart together. What is taking the most out of you right now?","Running on empty while life keeps asking more is crushing. What would rest even look like tonight?"],t.s)
B.bsR=s(["Watching everyone else look fine while you carry this quietly is crushing. What comparison cuts deepest?","Feeling behind while everyone looks ahead is a lonely kind of pain. Where do you feel behind?"],t.s)
B.bqX=s(["Home is supposed to be the safe place, so hurt there cuts deeper. What is happening at home?","When the pain comes from the people closest, it is confusing as well as heavy. Tell me what it looks like."],t.s)
B.bs0=s(["Hurt inside a marriage is its own kind of lonely, because it comes from the person meant to be closest. What is it like between you right now?","You sound worn by what is happening in your marriage, and still you are looking for a way through. What is the heaviest part of it?"],t.s)
B.bdP=s(["Money worry sits in the body \u2014 the sleep, the chest, the constant counting. I am listening. What is pressing hardest: the debt, the bills, or the not knowing?","Carrying money fear quietly makes it twice as heavy. You said it out loud, and that took something. What does next month look like from where you stand?"],t.s)
B.byU=s(["Being sick or in pain changes everything at once \u2014 the body, the plans, the future. You do not have to be brave here. What is the hardest part today?","Illness asks so much of a person, quietly. I am listening. Where is it heaviest \u2014 the body, or the fear around it?"],t.s)
B.aS9=s(["Hurt that comes from family cuts deepest, because these are the people who were meant to be safe. What is happening between you?","Loving your family and being hurt by them at the same time is confusing and heavy. Tell me what it looks like from inside."],t.s)
B.bcy=s(["That shame is heavy, and you still said it out loud, which takes courage. I am not here to judge you. What weighs most?","Feeling ashamed of yourself is a painful place to be, and you are still here, still trying. What does it tell you about yourself?"],t.s)
B.b6T=s(["When everything feels pointless, even small steps feel far away. I am here with you in it. What feels most hopeless?","It sounds like hope has gone quiet for you right now. That is a heavy place to sit. What does it feel like from the inside?"],t.s)
