B.bJH=new A.Q(B.Zi,["Hello. How are you today?",u.yS,"No agenda, I just like to check in now and then. How are you really doing?",u.CU],t.w)
B.az4=new A.mr("Teach me a letter","Ask your child to teach you one letter they know, the way a teacher would. Say it wrong once and let them correct you.")
B.azb=new A.mr("Letter hunt","Pick one letter and look for it for five minutes: on a page, a sign, a mug. Whoever finds it says its name.")
B.az6=new A.mr("Take turns","Open the next letter lesson and take turns, you then your child. Stop while it is still fun.")
B.boB=s([B.az4,B.azb,B.az6],t.Um)
B.azd=new A.mr("Ask, do not test","Ask one real question about something they are studying, and listen. The goal is their voice, not their score.")
B.az7=new A.mr("Choose together","Let them pick the school they want to explore this week. Your job is to be curious about their choice.")
B.az5=new A.mr("Teach back","Ask them to teach you one thing they learned that you did not know. Thank them for it.")
B.beK=s([B.azd,B.az7,B.az5],t.Um)
B.az9=new A.mr("A shared five minutes","Pick one short lesson and do it at the same time as your family, then say one thing you each noticed.")
B.az3=new A.mr("Learn in front of them","Children copy what they see. Let them see you learning, and say out loud when something is hard for you.")
B.aza=new A.mr("Ask them","Ask each person at home what they would like to learn next, and write the answers down.")
B.bB3=s([B.az9,B.az3,B.aza],t.Um)
B.bJI=new A.Q(B.Zi,[B.boB,B.PO,B.beK,B.bB3],A.a6("Q<l,x<mr>>"))
B.b6y=s(["That is outside what I do, and I cannot set aside how I work. I am H\u0101di, the guide to Islam and this app, and I answer from the Qur\u2019an and the Sunnah with sources. Ask me about worship, halal and haram, the Prophet\u2019s life, family, or where something is in the app."],t.s)
B.bi0=s(["That is outside what I do, and I will not help with anything that could hurt people. If you are in danger, or are thinking of harming someone or yourself, please contact your local emergency number or someone you trust now. If anger or pain is behind the question, I can share du\u2019as and guidance for it: the Sakina screen is made for that.\n[GO:/sakina]"],t.s)
B.byI=s(["That is outside what I do: I have no live weather. Your phone\u2019s weather app will tell you. What I can show for your location is when each prayer begins today, on the Prayer Times screen.\n[GO:/prayer]","That is outside what I do, and I cannot see a forecast. For the weather use your phone\u2019s weather app. If you are planning your day around prayer, Prayer Times has today\u2019s times.\n[GO:/prayer]"],t.s)
B.be2=s(["That is outside what I do: I cannot see a clock or a calendar, so I would only be guessing the time. Your device shows it. For the Islamic date there is the Islamic Calendar, and for when each prayer begins today there is Prayer Times.\n[GO:/calendar]\n[GO:/prayer]"],t.s)
B.aUI=s(["That is outside what I do: I do not follow sports scores or news, so I cannot tell you who won. A sports app or a news site will be better. I am here for Islam and this app; try asking about prayer, fasting, the Qur\u2019an or the Prophet\u2019s life."],t.s)
B.b4W=s(["That is outside what I do: I do not follow politics or who holds an office, and anything I said could be out of date, so I will not name anyone. For Islam\u2019s guidance on justice, honesty and leadership I can help, and I can say what the Qur\u2019an and Sunnah teach."],t.s)
B.bnv=s(["That is outside what I do: I do not have recipes. What I can do is tell you whether an ingredient is halal (try \u201cis gelatin halal\u201d) and how to eat with good manners. The Masajid and Halal screen lists halal places near you.\n[GO:/masajid]\n[GO:/huda/guide?id=huda-food]"],t.s)
B.b96=s(["That is outside what I do: I will not write your homework or essay. If your topic is Islam, I can explain it from the Qur\u2019an and the Sunnah with sources you can cite, and the Academy has the Seerah, Aqeedah and Hadith schools to study from.\n[GO:/academy]"],t.s)
B.bkm=s(["That is outside what I do: I do not tell jokes. If you would like something light and true, the Stories section has short stories from the Prophets and the Companions, and the Games are a good way to unwind.\n[GO:/stories]\n[GO:/games]"],t.s)
B.aVU=s(["That is outside what I do: I am not a calculator, and I would not want to give you a wrong number. Your phone\u2019s calculator will do it. If the sum is for zakat, the Zakat calculator in the app does the arithmetic.\n[GO:/zakat]"],t.s)
B.aPy=s(["That is outside what I do: I do not translate between languages. For the meaning of a Qur\u2019an verse, the Qur\u2019an screen shows an English translation under the Arabic. For the Arabic of the Qur\u2019an, the Quranic Arabic school teaches the words.\n[GO:/quran]\n[GO:/academy/quranic-arabic]"],t.s)
B.b30=s(["That is outside what I do: I do not write poems, songs or stories of my own. The Stories section has true stories from the Prophets, and the Qur\u2019an screen has the finest words there are.\n[GO:/stories]\n[GO:/quran]"],t.s)
B.b1T=s(["That is outside what I do: everyday advice, shopping and planning are not on my shelf, and I would only be offering my own opinion. What I can give you is what Islam says about the matter, such as manners, honesty, family, halal and haram, and how to use your time well. Ask me in those terms and I will answer with sources."],t.s)
B.bhq=s(["That is outside what I do: I cannot help with phones, computers or code. If something in this app is not working, tell me which screen and what you see, and I will point you to the right place in Settings or Downloads.\n[GO:/settings]"],t.s)
